; Like Bison, a grammar error is reported only once three tokens were read
; since the last one: a line break, an indent and each sign count, a comment
; does not. Each case below follows an open that resets the count.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A

2020-01-02 open "x"
"y"
2020-01-02 open "x"
2020-01-02 open Assets:Sep1

2020-01-03 open "x"
2020-01-03 "y"
2020-01-03 open Assets:Sep2

2020-01-04 open "x"
  "y"
2020-01-04 open Assets:Sep3

2020-01-05 open "x"
  -5 "y"
2020-01-05 open Assets:Sep4

2020-01-06 open "x"
  ; c
  "y"
2020-01-06 open Assets:Sep5

2020-01-07 open "x"

"y"
2020-01-07 open Assets:Sep6

2020-01-08 open "x"
2020-01-08 open "y"
2020-01-08 open Assets:Sep7

2020-01-09 open "x"
  Assets:A Assets:B "y"
2020-01-09 open Assets:Sep8

2020-01-10 open "x"
- - "y"
2020-01-10 open Assets:Sep9

2020-01-11 open "x"
2020-01-11 open "x"
2020-01-11 open Assets:Sep10

2020-01-12 * "a" "b" "c"
  Assets:A  1 USD
2020-01-12 open "x"
